# Ignore generated output, local tooling, and local agent instructions.
# Source, configuration, tests, and project documentation remain eligible for Git.
# Keep schematic documents (Markdown, PDF, SVG, PNG, and TeX) eligible as well;
# save maintained documents under docs/, outside ignored output directories.
# New documents and code changes are included with git add, not ignore entries.
# Maintained GitHub release notes under docs/ remain trackable, including
# docs/release_notes_v1.0.0-beta.md. Release firmware and build output stay ignored.

# Local project instructions; do not publish to GitHub.
/AGENTS.md

# PlatformIO: .pio/core cache, .pio/p packages, .pio/tools compilers,
# .pio/build combined companion firmware, native/native_delivery tests, probes and logs.
# Keep temporary gesture traces and false-alarm verification logs under .pio/.
# Passive-buzzer PWM/polarity and attachment-readback regression executables,
# merged images and verification logs belong under .pio/. Keep
# test/test_alarm_buzzer/, driver source, docs/buzzer_module_reference.md and
# wiring/CLI documentation trackable.
# Calibration build/test/image checks also belong under .pio/; calibration source,
# test/test_gyro_calibration/ and docs/gyro_calibration.md remain trackable.
# USB CLI/statistics build output and native-test executables also belong under
# .pio/; keep examples/companion_radio/ source, test/test_usb_cli/ and
# docs/usb_cli_reference.md trackable. No sensor logs are generated by statistics.
.pio/
platformio.local.ini

# Firmware exported to the project root (including MERGED_BIN_PATH overrides).
# Keep arbitrary binary fixtures elsewhere eligible for version control.
/firmware.bin
/firmware-merged.bin
/bootloader.bin
/partitions.bin
/boot_app0.bin
/*-merged.bin
/heltec_v4_companion_radio_ble*.bin
# Companion build symbols/maps exported beside the firmware (not source fixtures).
/firmware.elf
/firmware.map
/heltec_v4_companion_radio_ble*.elf
/heltec_v4_companion_radio_ble*.map

# Local Python environments and generated bytecode.
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Generated build, verification, and diagnostic logs exported to the project root.
# Keep logs used as test fixtures or documentation outside the root trackable.
/build-validation.log
/test-validation.log
/verification.log
/verification-paths.log
/*-verification.log
/*-validation.log
/*-verify.log
/*-build.log
/*-tests.log
/*-tests.xml
/*-probe.log
/*-image-info.log
/gyro-calibration.log
/platformio-install.log

# Editor and language-server state.
.vscode/.browse.c_cpp.db*
.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json
.vscode/launch.json
.vscode/ipch/
.vscode/settings.json
.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
cmake-*
.cache
.ccls
compile_commands.json

# Other local output and operating-system metadata.
out/
.direnv/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
